        <mxCell id="sg_details" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontColor=#78350F;fontSize=10;" value="• bastion-sg: Inbound SSH (22) from var.my_ip_cidr only. Outbound: 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;• webserver-sg: Inbound HTTP (80) from 0.0.0.0/0, SSH (22) from bastion-sg. Outbound: 0.0.0.0/0&#xa;• appserver-sg: Inbound TCP (5000) from webserver-sg ID, SSH (22) from bastion-sg. Outbound: HTTPS (443 via NAT) &amp; PG (5432)&#xa;• database-sg: Inbound PostgreSQL (5432) strictly from appserver-sg ID only. Outbound: None / Local VPC" vertex="1">
